<title>USA: Reno Air says interim CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Reno Air says interim CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reno Air Inc Thursday said interim Chief Financial Officer J.T. Fisher has accepted a job at another major international carrier.</p>
<p>He joined Reno Air in 1994 as director of planning and was appointed interim chief financial officer earlier this year.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it is currently in the &quot;final stages&quot; of finding a permanent Chief Financial Officer.</p>
</text>
